{"ticker":"CTAS","updated":"2026-11-27T22:46:55Z","profile":{"longName":"Cintas Corporation","shortName":"Cintas Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cintas.com","fullTimeEmployees":48100,"marketCap":90763427840,"trailingPE":45.084812,"forwardPE":37.10136,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.8510866,"pegRatio":3.16,"targetMeanPrice":218.4375,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":181.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.109,"earningsGrowth":0.133,"grossMargins":0.50990003,"operatingMargins":0.23615,"profitMargins":0.17824,"totalRevenue":11560620032,"beta":0.857,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":233.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":161.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.91},"summary":"Cintas Corporation provides corporate identity uniforms and other garments in the United States, Canada, and Latin America. It operates through Uniform Rental and Facility Services, First Aid and Safety Services, and All Other segments. The company offers rental and servicing of uniforms and other garments, including flame resistant clothing, mats, mops and shop towels, and other ancillary items. It also provides restroom cleaning services and supplies; and sells uniforms from catalogs. In addition, the company offers first aid and safety products and services; workplace water services; and fire protection products and services. Further, it provides automated external defibrillators; eye-wash stations; safety training; fire extinguishers; sprinkler systems; and alarm services. The company sells its products and services through its distribution network and local delivery routes, or local representatives to small service and manufacturing companies, as well as major corporations. It serves gaming, hospitality, healthcare, automotive, government, education, pharmaceutical, manufacturing, skilled trades, and food processing industries. The company was founded in 1929 and is based in Cincinnati, Ohio.","summary_zh":"Cintas Corporation 在美國、加拿大和拉丁美洲提供企業形象制服和其他服裝。它透過制服租賃和設施服務、急救和安全服務以及所有其他部門運作。該公司提供製服和其他服裝的租賃和服務，包括阻燃服裝、墊子、拖把和抹布以及其他輔助物品。它還提供衛生間清潔服務和用品​​；並銷售目錄中的製服。此外，該公司還提供急救和安全產品和服務；工作場所供水服務；以及消防產品和服務。此外，它還提供自動體外心臟去顫器；洗眼站；安全訓練；滅火器；灑水系統；和警報服務。該公司透過其分銷網路和當地交付路線或當地代表向小型服務和製造公司以及大公司銷售其產品和服務。它為遊戲、酒店、醫療保健、汽車、政府、教育、製藥、製造、技術貿易和食品加工行業提供服務。該公司成立於 1929 年，總部位於俄亥俄州辛辛那提。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"專業商業服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":205.7,"h":205.7,"l":203.04,"c":203.91,"v":1809300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":202.6,"h":205.93,"l":201.75,"c":205.26,"v":1822700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":204.07,"h":204.74,"l":202.5,"c":203.64,"v":1288500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":201.99,"h":203.47,"l":201.44,"c":202.91,"v":1713300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":202.88,"h":203.56,"l":201.78,"c":202.61,"v":1566800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":202.45,"h":202.71,"l":198.36,"c":199.04,"v":1565200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":199.04,"h":199.7,"l":197.01,"c":199.17,"v":1826400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":199.39,"h":199.39,"l":197.55,"c":198.81,"v":1507700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":198.4,"h":198.86,"l":191.37,"c":191.75,"v":2600700},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":191.21,"h":192.06,"l":187.29,"c":187.96,"v":3428200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":187.47,"h":189.44,"l":186.95,"c":187.94,"v":2094800},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":186.97,"h":189.48,"l":185.52,"c":188.23,"v":2702300},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":188.33,"h":189.57,"l":186.98,"c":187.45,"v":1506700},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":187.98,"h":187.98,"l":183.95,"c":184.36,"v":1593800},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":184.93,"h":189.4,"l":184.88,"c":188.1,"v":2511600},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":188.26,"h":193.81,"l":188.19,"c":192.33,"v":3569100},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":192.29,"h":197.62,"l":191.59,"c":196.49,"v":3360200},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":196.56,"h":197.0,"l":193.3,"c":193.54,"v":1322600},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":194.0,"h":195.73,"l":192.19,"c":192.34,"v":1842300},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":192.76,"h":192.95,"l":190.57,"c":190.83,"v":1309100},{"t":"2025-10-27","o":190.61,"h":191.25,"l":188.22,